{"id": "section-body-08386", "title": "Pulmonary Vascular Diseases (PVDS) and Cor Pulmonale", "chapterId": "chapter-nine", "blocks": [{"id": "body-08386", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Pulmonary Vascular Diseases (PVDS) and Cor Pulmonale", "runs": [{"text": "Pulmonary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Vascular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Diseases"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PVDS)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Cor"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Pulmonale"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1593"}}, {"id": "body-08387", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Pulmonary Vascular Diseases (PVDs) encompasses a group of disorders that affect the blood vessels within the lungs. These disorders disrupt normal pulmonary blood flow, potentially leading to impaired gas exchange and right ventricular overload or failure (Cor Pulmonale).", "runs": [{"text": "Pulmonary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Vascular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Diseases"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(PVDs)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "encompasses"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "group"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "disorders"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "affect"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "blood"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vessels"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "within"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lungs."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "These disorders disrupt normal pulmonary blood flow, potentially leading to impaired gas exchange and right ventricular overload or failure (Cor Pulmonale)."}]}, {"id": "body-08389", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "The major types are Pulmonary embolism, Pulmonary Hypertension, Pulmonary veno-occlusive disease, Pulmonary Arterio- Venous Malformation etc.", "runs": [{"text": "The major types are Pulmonary embolism, Pulmonary Hypertension, Pulmonary veno-occlu